{"severity":"error","file":"errors/cap_grant_exceeded_1.march","start_line":23,"start_col":2,"end_line":25,"end_col":5,"message":"`main` is granted `needs IO.Console`, but the program reaches `IO.FileWrite` (reached from `main`: main → greet). The grant is a ceiling on the WHOLE program — declaring `needs IO.FileWrite` does not raise it.\nhelp: add `IO.FileWrite` to `main`'s request (its `needs` clause, or the module's `needs` line when `main` has no clause), or request all of `IO`, or remove the use.","code":"cap_grant_exceeded","fix":{"kind":"replace","start_line":23,"start_col":33,"end_line":23,"end_col":33,"text":", IO.FileWrite","applicability":"machine-applicable"},"labels":[],"notes":[],"category":"CAPABILITY"}
